{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09137","headline":"杂言送黎六郎 · 韦应物","name":"杂言送黎六郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冰壶见底未见清，少年如玉有诗名。\n闻话嵩峰多野寺，不嫌黄绶向阳城。\n朱门严训朝辞去，骑出东郊满飞絮。\n河南庭下拜府君，阳城归路山氛氲。\n山氛氲，长不见，钓台水渌荷已生，少姨庙寒花始徧。\n县闲吏傲与尘隔，移竹疏泉常岸帻。\n莫言去作折腰官，岂似长安折腰客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}